          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.warptheory.tut_addon_warptheory.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "扭曲理论是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "warptheory:tut_addon_warptheory/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.warptheory.tut_addon_warptheory.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "扭曲理论大幅扩充了"
                },
                {
                  "text": "扭曲事件",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "：扭曲越高，越可能遇到各种新的怪事。作为补偿，它也提供了测量和清除扭曲的道具。\n它没有自己的分页，研究分布在"
                },
                {
                  "text": "炼金术",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "和"
                },
                {
                  "text": "邪术学",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "分页中。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "warptheory:tut_addon_warptheory/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "warptheory:tut_addon_warptheory/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.warptheory.tut_addon_warptheory.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "相关研究\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "warptheory:tut_addon_warptheory/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.warptheory.tut_addon_warptheory.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "warptheory:WARPPAPER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：奥术石蕊试纸，测量扭曲（隐藏研究，扫描特定要素发现）。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "warptheory:WARPSOMETHING"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：块状物（隐藏研究）。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "warptheory:WARPCLEANSER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：纯净泪水，清除扭曲，需要"
                },
                {
                  "research": "ELDRITCHMAJOR"
                },
                {
                  "text": "。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "warptheory:WARPAMULET"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：净化护身符。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
